<title>USA: Elk River ISD 728, Minn. won by First of America.</title>
<headline>Elk River ISD 728, Minn. won by First of America.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First of America Securities Inc. said it won $26 .950 million of   Elk River Ind Sch Dist No. 728, Minn., general obligation</p>
<p>school building bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.295 percent.</p>
</text>
